<title>USA: Forstmann to distribute Department 56 shares.</title>
<headline>Forstmann to distribute Department 56 shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Department 56 Inc said Wednesday said it filed a registration statement which will allow Forstmann Little &amp; Co to distribute about 2.2 million shares or 10.6 percent of Department 56 stock to Forstmann investors.</p>
</text>
